# Phase 53.4 — Self-building deploy upload filter.
#
# The Dockerfile now builds the SPA from source inside the container
# (multi-stage), so the upload context must INCLUDE web source + public
# assets. (This file previously stripped them because we shipped a
# pre-built dist.) We exclude only deps, VCS, the prebuilt dist, and
# heavy artifacts the build doesn't need.

# Never upload dependencies or VCS history.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.github

# Prebuilt output — the Dockerfile builds dist fresh now, so don't ship
# (or trust) a local one.
web/dist

# Generated native mobile projects + docs — not part of the web build.
mobile/ios
mobile/android
mobile/dist
docs

# Test + cache + build artifacts.
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/.vite
web/.cache
test-results
.parcel-cache
.next
.nuxt
.turbo

# Editor / OS / logs / envs.
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store
*.log
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Railway link metadata + local dev notes.
.railway

# Root-level debug screenshots ONLY. NB: root-anchored (`/*.png`) on
# purpose — a bare `*.png` matches every PNG at every depth and would
# strip web/public/icons/layers/*.png (the layer swatches) out of the
# build context. Do NOT un-anchor this.
/*.png
